    "title": "Portsmouth schools to close for multi-agency safety training Sept. 28 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Connor DeWine, Staff Writer ,\n7 hours ago PORTSMOUTH, Ohio — The Portsmouth City School District will close Portsmouth Junior/High School to the public Sept. 28 while several local public safety agencies conduct an annual training exercise there, according to a joint announcement posted by the Portsmouth Police Department. The training will be held in coordination with... Read full article",
